msgstr "Шлем не подключён"

#: launcher/core/checks.cpp
#, qt-format
msgid "Install it from your package manager."
msgstr "Установите его через менеджер пакетов."

#: launcher/core/checks.cpp
#, qt-format
msgid "Install the OpenXR loader from your package manager."
msgstr "Установите загрузчик OpenXR (OpenXR loader) через менеджер пакетов."

#: launcher/core/checks.cpp
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"It isn't in Steam's libraries or the usual GOG folders. Choose its folder."
msgstr ""
"Его нет ни в библиотеках Steam, ни в обычных папках GOG. Укажите его папку."

#: launcher/core/checks.cpp
#, qt-format
msgid "It needs Vulkan 1.2 with multiview and at least 7 descriptor sets."
msgstr "Нужен Vulkan 1.2 с multiview и не менее 7 наборов дескрипторов."

#: launcher/core/checks.cpp
